{"version":1,"content":"<p>特斯拉最新推出的完全自動駕駛（FSD）更新，帶來了遠超傳統駕駛可視化界面的技術。據行政總裁埃隆·馬斯克介紹，該公司正在車輛內部直接運行一個參數規模約達10億（1 billion）的擴散模型，以相當有限的計算資源實時生成車輛周圍環境的逼真畫面。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587842.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T11:44:14.792402+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":126,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T11:27:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T11:37:13.981379+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T11:37:13.981379+00:00","content_hash":"42ff750f3be4fc54e8cc2e8302f4a438941cbaeaa4ccd1f8c0e8ae62f6b5c972","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}